Here is the commit message:
upipe_avcdec: fix audio, add audio pts

Fix audio bug introduced in 9683efc4, add pts code for
audio frames.

Here is the root cause:
The bug was introduced due to the removal of proper handling for audio frame timing attributes, specifically the PTS (Presentation Time Stamp) and the incorrect management of the DTS (Decoding Time Stamp). This led to issues in audio synchronization, as the system was not correctly calculating or setting the necessary timing information for audio frames. The changes made in the patch aimed to fix this by consolidating the timing logic and ensuring that PTS is correctly computed and set for audio frames.

